---
// Hackathons.astro - Section 6: Hackathons & Competitions with Bento Grid & Counters
---

<section id="hackathons" class="py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-12">
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-accent-amber">05 // Competitividad & Innovación</div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-content-primary">Hackathons & Reconocimientos</h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-content-secondary max-w-xl">
      Desafíos intensos de 24 a 48 horas donde ideamos, construimos y desplegamos prototipos viables bajo presión extrema.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid Container -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    
    <!-- Bento 1: Main Award (Span 2 cols on md) -->
    <div class="gsap-bento-card md:col-span-2 p-7 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-accent-indigo/40 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-36 h-36 bg-accent-indigo/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-accent-indigo/20 transition-all duration-500"></div>

      <div class="space-y-3 relative z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-accent-amber/15 border border-accent-amber/40 text-accent-amber">
            🥇 1er Lugar General
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-content-muted">Global AI & Web Innovation 2025</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-content-primary">
          NeuroMesh: Diagnóstico Asistido con Edge AI
        </h3>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-content-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
          Prototipo de clasificación de imágenes médicas que procesa modelos locales en el navegador mediante WebAssembly y WebGPU, reduciendo el costo de inferencia a cero en servidores externos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-content-muted relative z-10">
        <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-surface-card border border-border-subtle">48 Horas</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-surface-card border border-border-subtle">WebGPU</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-surface-card border border-border-subtle">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-surface-card border border-border-subtle">+120 Equipos</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 2: Stat Box with GSAP Animated Counter -->
    <div class="gsap-bento-card p-7 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border-subtle flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 shadow-xl">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-accent-indigo font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Métricas Competitivas</div>
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold font-mono text-content-primary gsap-counter" data-target="8" data-suffix="+">
            0
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-content-muted mt-1">Hackathons Completados</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-border-subtle pt-3">
          <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold font-mono text-accent-cyan gsap-counter" data-target="5" data-suffix="">
            0
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-content-muted mt-1">Podios & Premios Ganados</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-accent-emerald flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-border-subtle">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-emerald"></span>
        62% Tasa de Podio
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 3: Second Award -->
    <div class="gsap-bento-card p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border-subtle flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 shadow-xl">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-semibold bg-accent-cyan/15 border border-accent-cyan/40 text-accent-cyan">
            🥈 2do Lugar
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-content-muted">GreenCode Hack 2024</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-content-primary">EcoRoute Optimizer</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Algoritmo de ruteo logístico para minimizar la huella de carbono de flotas eléctricas en tiempo real.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-content-muted pt-2 border-t border-border-subtle">
        Stack: Node.js, Graphhopper, Mapbox GL
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 4: Special Mention (Span 2 cols on md) -->
    <div class="gsap-bento-card md:col-span-2 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border-subtle flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 shadow-xl">
      <div class="space-y-1.5 max-w-md">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent-indigo font-mono">🌟 Premio al Mejor Diseño UI/UX</div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-content-primary">FinFlow: Visualizador de Finanzas Descentralizadas</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-content-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Reconocido por el jurado por su interfaz con visualizaciones 3D en Three.js fluidas en pantallas móviles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-content-secondary sm:text-right shrink-0">
        <div class="text-content-primary font-bold">ETH Global Hack</div>
        <div class="text-content-muted">Edición 2024</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
